- Yes, please take it.

276
00:11:42,347 --> 00:11:44,577
(Crazy Flavour Restaurant sold 8 dishes.)

277
00:11:45,447 --> 00:11:47,487
We have to fry them according to the numbers.

278
00:11:47,847 --> 00:11:48,887
There's enough chicken.

279
00:11:49,887 --> 00:11:50,917
Shrimp.

280
00:11:52,187 --> 00:11:53,317
There's shrimp too.

281
00:11:53,927 --> 00:11:55,687
We have no squid rings right now.

282
00:11:56,127 --> 00:11:57,897
Can you fry four squid rings?

283
00:11:58,627 --> 00:12:01,097
Really? They run out fast.

284
00:12:02,167 --> 00:12:05,297
We had three different items. And as we were making a lot,

285
00:12:05,537 --> 00:12:07,107
it was taking longer than expected.

286
00:12:07,737 --> 00:12:09,967
Is this all...

287
00:12:09,967 --> 00:12:12,207
