- I'll fry more right away.

288
00:12:12,707 --> 00:12:14,707
- Please keep frying them.
- Okay.

289
00:12:14,707 --> 00:12:16,307
(1 of the 3 items keeps running short.)

290
00:12:16,547 --> 00:12:18,377
Pay immediately? One?

291
00:12:18,377 --> 00:12:19,677
- Yes.
- Would you like to pay?

292
00:12:20,247 --> 00:12:21,487
Can you make one more?

293
00:12:21,687 --> 00:12:22,987
Please wait for a minute.

294
00:12:22,987 --> 00:12:24,017
It'll take two minutes.

295
00:12:25,287 --> 00:12:26,787
You can take your time,

296
00:12:26,787 --> 00:12:28,687
- but please fry them as a full set.
- Okay.

297
00:12:29,157 --> 00:12:30,797
We're just frying it now, so please wait.

298
00:12:30,797 --> 00:12:32,427
- Okay.
- We'll make it very delicious.

299
00:12:34,297 --> 00:12:35,627
The frying was taking...

300
00:12:36,027 --> 00:12:37,597
