301
00:12:38,537 --> 00:12:39,767
I started to get anxious.

302
00:12:40,097 --> 00:12:41,937
Can I fry with him?

303
00:12:41,937 --> 00:12:43,777
- Go ahead.
- It's okay.

304
00:12:44,737 --> 00:12:47,007
- We need 14 sets.
- Take the chicken.

305
00:12:47,007 --> 00:12:48,147
Take the chicken.

306
00:12:49,877 --> 00:12:52,577
We're not fast enough. Can you fry next to him?

307
00:12:52,977 --> 00:12:54,187
They get mixed?

308
00:12:54,887 --> 00:12:56,647
Otherwise, we wouldn't get the quality we want.

309
00:12:56,647 --> 00:12:58,387
