315
00:13:11,037 --> 00:13:14,137
(The line of waiting customers is getting longer.)

316
00:13:14,467 --> 00:13:15,637
Enjoy your food.

317
00:13:16,037 --> 00:13:17,377
Please pick up your order.

318
00:13:17,807 --> 00:13:20,037
- I'll serve the 2 right away.
- Okay, 2.

319
00:13:20,447 --> 00:13:21,607
We can do this.

320
00:13:22,577 --> 00:13:24,547
It's a race against time, so we need to get the orders out fast.

321
00:13:25,177 --> 00:13:27,347
We had our orders piled up.

322
00:13:33,217 --> 00:13:35,027
Could you speed up the frying a little?

323
00:13:35,127 --> 00:13:36,357
I'll help him with frying from now on.

324
00:13:36,987 --> 00:13:38,927
It has to be coated with batter.

325
00:13:39,257 --> 00:13:40,727
I'll take care of it.

326
00:13:40,867 --> 00:13:41,927
Like that?

327
00:13:43,797 --> 00:13:47,507
(Putting fritters in the wok as well)

328
00:13:48,707 --> 00:13:51,007
(Making the fritter coating with a spatula)

329
00:13:51,237 --> 00:13:53,207
I really didn't want to get eliminated.

330
00:13:54,007 --> 00:13:56,907
You should put the chicken on the skewers instead.

331
00:13:57,817 --> 00:13:59,817
- I haven't put all of it yet.
- The orders need to go out now.

332
00:13:59,947 --> 00:14:01,017
The fritters are over there.

333
00:14:01,517 --> 00:14:04,117
- We need to send out 16 sets.
- I know.

334
00:14:04,557 --> 00:14:05,687
I was very flustered.

335
00:14:06,217 --> 00:14:07,587
As he had already started helping me,

336
00:14:08,087 --> 00:14:10,997
