337
00:14:16,697 --> 00:14:17,867
Can we keep going?

338
00:14:19,397 --> 00:14:21,367
- We can send out five more dishes.
- Okay.

339
00:14:22,007 --> 00:14:23,507
Hello, please take your order.

340
00:14:23,507 --> 00:14:24,777
- Thank you.
- You're welcome.

341
00:14:25,007 --> 00:14:26,077
Hello.

342
00:14:26,077 --> 00:14:27,447
