343
00:14:27,447 --> 00:14:28,677
What's your number?

344
00:14:28,747 --> 00:14:30,647
Dip it in gochujang aioli.

345
00:14:30,947 --> 00:14:31,947
Okay.

346
00:14:31,947 --> 00:14:33,747
Only two teams survive,

347
00:14:33,747 --> 00:14:35,517
