353
00:14:59,277 --> 00:15:01,907
(Dance 1)

354
00:15:01,907 --> 00:15:05,317
(Dance 2)

355
00:15:06,377 --> 00:15:08,217
(Surprised)

356
00:15:08,787 --> 00:15:09,817
(Thank you for ordering.)

357
00:15:09,817 --> 00:15:12,217
Because we ordered this.

358
00:15:12,657 --> 00:15:13,757
Just for this...

359
00:15:14,727 --> 00:15:16,657
(I can't see right now.)

360
00:15:16,657 --> 00:15:18,157
He's so cute.

361
00:15:18,927 --> 00:15:19,997
Seriously.

362
00:15:20,767 --> 00:15:21,797
That...

363
00:15:21,797 --> 00:15:25,537
(Bouquet fritters and honey garlic fried rice cakes)

364
00:15:25,537 --> 00:15:26,797
- Eat first.
- Gosh.

365
00:15:27,267 --> 00:15:29,067
Try the rice cake. It's good.

366
00:15:29,867 --> 00:15:31,337
- Is the rice cake good?
- It's good.

367
00:15:32,377 --> 00:15:33,707
(Crispy)

368
00:15:33,707 --> 00:15:34,907
That sound.

369
00:15:38,477 --> 00:15:39,617
I like the rice cake.

370
00:15:39,917 --> 00:15:40,917
- Is the rice cake good?
- Yes.

371
00:15:40,917 --> 00:15:42,887
Deep-fried squid is amazing. It's so good.

372
00:15:42,887 --> 00:15:44,487
The rice cake tastes like garlic bread.

373
00:15:44,817 --> 00:15:46,917
- The fritter.
- It's delicious.

374
00:15:47,287 --> 00:15:48,457
The batter is fantastic.

375
00:15:48,587 --> 00:15:50,657
(Amazed)

376
00:15:50,657 --> 00:15:51,957
I've never had such a fritter before.

377
00:15:52,657 --> 00:15:54,927
The rice cake is so chewy and nice.

378
00:15:54,927 --> 00:15:55,927
This is amazing.

379
00:15:56,127 --> 00:15:57,437
This is tasty too.

380
00:15:57,937 --> 00:15:59,667
Deep-fried squid tastes great.

381
00:16:01,207 --> 00:16:02,307
I'll take a short break.

382
00:16:03,867 --> 00:16:05,937
- Drink water.
- I was the most popular one.

383
00:16:06,077 --> 00:16:07,207
I can imagine.

384
00:16:07,877 --> 00:16:09,047
