412
00:17:14,807 --> 00:17:16,207
We need to find out why.

413
00:17:17,517 --> 00:17:18,577
What could it be?

414
00:17:19,647 --> 00:17:21,587
Maybe because it's hard to pull it out of a skewer.

415
00:17:23,087 --> 00:17:25,157
It grabs onto the skewer when it gets cooked.

416
00:17:25,717 --> 00:17:27,757
Shrimps and squids grab onto the skewer.

417
00:17:29,057 --> 00:17:33,127
When they pulled it out of the skewer,

418
00:17:33,657 --> 00:17:36,467
