419
00:17:37,067 --> 00:17:38,237
Could that be why?

420
00:17:38,237 --> 00:17:42,037
I thought it was my dish's problem.

421
00:17:42,507 --> 00:17:44,277
Skewers are hard to eat.

422
00:17:45,607 --> 00:17:46,807
