423
00:17:53,547 --> 00:17:55,587
(Annoyed)

424
00:17:55,587 --> 00:17:56,717
This is pissing me off.

425
00:17:57,047 --> 00:17:59,157
I hope they'll serve it without the skewer.

426
00:17:59,157 --> 00:18:00,987
Me too.

427
00:18:00,987 --> 00:18:02,057
It's so hard to eat.

428
00:18:02,887 --> 00:18:04,257
Normally,

429
00:18:04,257 --> 00:18:07,397
