435
00:18:23,607 --> 00:18:25,477
- Can I have this?
- Yes. You can eat it.

436
00:18:25,777 --> 00:18:26,877
What?

437
00:18:28,287 --> 00:18:29,447
Pull it out?

438
00:18:30,287 --> 00:18:32,487
Twist it and pull it out?

439
00:18:32,657 --> 00:18:35,057
- Okay.
- No wonder it won't come off.

440
00:18:38,157 --> 00:18:39,627
- Twist it?
- Twist it? Okay.

441
00:18:40,257 --> 00:18:41,397
This is...

442
00:18:41,897 --> 00:18:44,137
