- We'll stir-fry noodles...

468
00:19:40,117 --> 00:19:42,027
Can we just do bao and tangsuyuk?

469
00:19:42,527 --> 00:19:44,027
We can't do that.

470
00:19:44,327 --> 00:19:45,827
If we fill up the plate generously,

471
00:19:45,827 --> 00:19:47,567
people won't be able to resist it.

472
00:19:47,797 --> 00:19:49,727
They won't be able to resist it.

473
00:19:49,767 --> 00:19:52,097
I'm confident I can sell it quickly and call it a day.

474
00:19:52,097 --> 00:19:53,167
